WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.000 --> 00:06.320
Disclaimer: The characters, behaviors, locations, organizations, professions, and events depicted in this series

3
00:06.320 --> 00:07.520
are entirely fictional and created solely for entertainment purposes.

4
00:07.520 --> 00:08.800
This series is not intended to guide, influence, or encourage any actions portrayed herein.

5
00:08.800 --> 00:10.040
Viewer discretion is advised.

6
00:10.040 --> 00:11.160
I'm breaking up with you.

7
00:11.160 --> 00:13.200
Bua, no.

8
00:13.200 --> 00:13.920
I'm not breaking up with you.

9
00:13.920 --> 00:15.120
Zip it up a bit.

10
00:15.120 --> 00:16.360
We have sweat glands. Humans have sweat glands.

11
00:18.440 --> 00:21.440
I'm not his boyfriend,

12
00:21.960 --> 00:24.160
no matter how badly he wants me.

13
00:36.960 --> 00:38.200
The breakup...

14
00:40.000 --> 00:41.200
was it because of me?

15
01:08.800 --> 01:11.240
When you asked if we broke up because of you...

16
01:11.960 --> 01:14.960
How did you even know?

17
01:16.880 --> 01:19.160
Well, Dad, you said it yourself back then that...

18
01:21.920 --> 01:24.920
Ever since you opened the shop, you haven't seen anyone besides customers.

19
01:25.600 --> 01:27.000
And as for Daddy Bua...

20
01:27.000 --> 01:29.400
Ever since he quit being an actor, he's spent all his time with me.

21
01:29.480 --> 01:32.479
He didn't see any friends, didn't go anywhere.

22
01:35.000 --> 01:36.240
If you were gonna break up over anyone,

23
01:39.520 --> 01:41.560
it's gotta be because of me, right?

24
01:41.560 --> 01:43.240
It couldn't be because of the customers.

25
01:54.759 --> 01:58.000
I really didn't want you thinking it was because of you.

26
01:59.840 --> 02:03.080
Honestly, it was because...

27
02:03.080 --> 02:05.480
It was because of me.

28
02:12.160 --> 02:15.880
I loved you so much,

29
02:15.880 --> 02:20.320
and I wanted to be with you all the time,

30
02:20.320 --> 02:28.960
to the point where I didn't have time or attention left for Daddy Baa.

31
02:33.000 --> 02:41.440
Daddy Baa had his worries, he felt left out sometimes...

32
02:41.440 --> 02:44.440
just like a clingy little puppy.

33
02:48.520 --> 02:52.040
At first, it probably sounded ridiculous, right?

34
02:52.040 --> 02:54.520
A dad being jealous of his own kid.

35
02:56.880 --> 02:59.880
But when I really thought about it, son...

36
03:01.720 --> 03:03.960
it was on me.

37
03:03.960 --> 03:06.960
I really did change.

38
03:10.520 --> 03:13.520
I just didn't have romantic feelings for Daddy Baa anymore.

39
03:22.800 --> 03:25.560
I'm so sorry, son.

40
03:25.560 --> 03:28.800
I love you so much.

41
03:28.800 --> 03:31.800
I didn't want to tell you because I didn't want you feeling bad.

42
03:36.440 --> 03:39.440
It really wasn't because of you.

43
03:43.760 --> 03:48.480
I understand. It's okay. I love you too, muah.

44
03:48.480 --> 03:51.360
Don't overthink it, Dad.

45
03:55.920 --> 03:57.720
And what about you?

46
03:57.720 --> 03:59.040
Moving over there,

47
03:59.040 --> 04:00.000
trying out breaking up,

48
04:00.000 --> 04:02.440
giving each other space...

49
04:02.440 --> 04:05.440
did it make things better?

50
04:45.680 --> 04:48.280
You still kept the memory card?

51
04:48.280 --> 04:51.280
Can I see it?

52
05:40.320 --> 05:42.720
I feel guilty

53
05:48.080 --> 05:53.440
for not keeping the photos you took for me.

54
05:58.200 --> 06:01.200
I'm sorry.

55
06:48.440 --> 06:51.440
I tried, I really did.

56
06:52.640 --> 06:55.640
Just like what I told our kid.

57
06:57.040 --> 07:00.040
Even after going to the States and coming back...

58
07:01.000 --> 07:05.600
the feeling is still the same.

59
07:15.520 --> 07:18.520
But...

60
07:22.240 --> 07:26.760
I still want you in my life as a friend.

61
08:31.640 --> 08:34.640
I only ask for one thing.

62
08:37.840 --> 08:40.840
Please don't go anywhere.

63
08:46.560 --> 08:49.560
Even if it's just as friends,

64
08:53.880 --> 08:56.880
stay and help take care of Baby first, okay?

65
10:51.280 --> 10:55.120
He's striking more poses than his dad now.

66
10:55.120 --> 10:56.800
Don't gas him up too much, or it'll go straight to his head.

67
10:56.800 --> 10:59.800
Way too handsome!

68
11:03.000 --> 11:03.920
A bit more, just a little more.

69
11:03.920 --> 11:07.080
Switch poses, switch it up!

70
11:07.080 --> 11:08.360
Still not enough, Dad?

71
11:08.360 --> 11:09.840
Let's get everything on the table.

72
11:09.840 --> 11:11.120
Anything left?

73
11:11.120 --> 11:12.080
All out.

74
11:12.080 --> 11:15.080
Yeah, nothing left now.

75
11:19.680 --> 11:21.600
Come on, we're ready.

76
11:21.600 --> 11:22.480
Alright.

77
11:22.480 --> 11:24.120
Daddy Chian, Daddy Bua, this camera, okay?

78
11:24.120 --> 11:27.120
3, 2, 1, let's go!

79
11:27.800 --> 11:30.320
Yes, yes! Slay!

80
11:30.320 --> 11:32.840
More, more, more!

81
11:32.840 --> 11:35.640
Fabulous, c'mon now.

82
11:35.640 --> 11:36.880
More!

83
11:36.880 --> 11:38.320
That's enough, I'm embarrassed now.

84
11:38.320 --> 11:41.760
I'm embarrassed. Let me see. Is it cute?

85
11:44.000 --> 11:44.600
Yes, it is.

86
11:44.600 --> 11:45.560
Yeah, just like old times, right?

87
11:45.560 --> 11:46.080
Totally.

88
11:46.080 --> 11:47.320
Yeah.

89
11:47.320 --> 11:48.360
Slay!

90
11:48.360 --> 11:50.120
Oh, hey Baa, Fou4Mod!

91
11:50.120 --> 11:51.480
Hey, come check this out, hurry!

92
11:51.480 --> 11:52.920
What are you guys doing?

93
11:52.920 --> 11:55.480
The dance from just now, come take a look.

94
11:55.480 --> 11:57.280
Does it look like old times?

95
11:57.280 --> 11:58.720
Whoa, still nailed it.

96
11:58.720 --> 11:59.520
Just like when you were kids.

97
11:59.520 --> 12:00.640
Cute, right?

98
12:00.640 --> 12:02.000
Is it okay?

99
12:02.000 --> 12:03.760
Well...it looks nice and aged.

100
12:03.760 --> 12:05.840
Hey, watch your mouth.

101
12:05.840 --> 12:08.840
Watch your mouth, watch your mouth!

102
12:12.040 --> 12:13.800
Alright, let's go.

103
12:13.800 --> 12:14.520
Let's head inside already.

104
12:14.520 --> 12:15.080
I was giving you a compliment.

105
12:15.080 --> 12:16.680
Let's go, let's go.

106
12:16.680 --> 12:19.680
Come on, sweetie.

107
12:38.080 --> 12:42.840
Thank you so much to all the guests who came today.

108
12:42.840 --> 12:44.960
Thank you to our families,

109
12:44.960 --> 12:47.320
thank you to our friends from Yurawit,

110
12:47.320 --> 12:49.440
our friends from Accounting,

111
12:49.440 --> 12:51.560
fellow SUGAR,

112
12:51.560 --> 12:54.560
and everyone in the SUGAR family.

113
12:56.400 --> 13:00.680
And thank you very much to P Four and your family

114
13:00.680 --> 13:03.680
for coming to our wedding today.

115
13:03.680 --> 13:08.000
You are the reason the two of us met.

116
13:14.760 --> 13:18.840
Today is the absolute best day of my life as a fangirl.

117
13:18.840 --> 13:20.480
I never would have thought

118
13:20.480 --> 13:23.480
that you'd actually come to a fan's wedding.

119
13:25.560 --> 13:29.160
You're still the same lovely person you've always been.

120
13:29.160 --> 13:33.160
You hit the gym and stay fit and healthy

121
13:33.160 --> 13:36.400
just so you can stay with your fans for a long time.

122
13:36.400 --> 13:39.760
Plus, you're covered in tattoos now...

123
13:39.760 --> 13:42.680
which is insanely attractive!

124
13:42.680 --> 13:44.240
So cute...

125
13:44.240 --> 13:47.240
You were our first love.

126
13:52.920 --> 13:56.120
Because we loved P Four,

127
13:56.120 --> 13:59.320
we were able to find each other.

128
13:59.320 --> 14:01.480
It took us a really long time

129
14:01.480 --> 14:05.920
to love each other as much as we love you.

130
14:05.920 --> 14:08.080
And today has finally come,

131
14:08.080 --> 14:15.000
the day our wings grew strong enough to fall in love with each other.

132
14:15.000 --> 14:18.440
This is the only time in my life my heart has ever wandered.

133
14:18.440 --> 14:22.320
Even so, we practiced loving you with all our hearts,

134
14:22.320 --> 14:25.320
which is why we know how to love each other so well.

135
14:28.160 --> 14:32.440
It's crazy, declaring love for my idol at my own wedding.

136
14:42.800 --> 14:47.800
And I also want to thank Chian.

137
14:57.320 --> 15:00.320
You're our idol when it comes to love.

138
15:03.760 --> 15:07.360
Who knows how long you two had to keep it a secret,

139
15:08.800 --> 15:12.360
how tightly you had to hold each other's hands,

140
15:12.360 --> 15:17.120
before getting to a day where you have such an adorable kid.

141
15:21.320 --> 15:27.040
The two of you made us feel like...

142
15:27.040 --> 15:30.040
we want to stan our own partner

143
15:35.880 --> 15:38.520
just as much as we stan our idol.

144
15:41.760 --> 15:45.360
I wish P Four and Chian a long and lasting love,

145
15:46.640 --> 15:51.160
and that you'll never have to part ways ever again.

146
15:51.160 --> 15:56.240
We're definitely following in your footsteps.

147
16:06.760 --> 16:08.560
Do our whole family really have to move to America?

148
16:08.560 --> 16:09.600
Can I not go?

149
16:09.600 --> 16:11.920
I don't have any friends over there.

150
16:12.760 --> 16:15.640
I already told you I'm not going anymore.

151
16:19.080 --> 16:19.800
Is this a gift?

152
16:19.800 --> 16:22.080
Yeah.

153
16:22.080 --> 16:22.880
Thank you.

154
16:32.440 --> 16:33.040
Chian.

155
16:33.040 --> 16:35.040
Yeah?

156
16:35.040 --> 16:38.040
I'll stay with our son.

157
16:38.040 --> 16:40.480
You should go.

158
16:40.480 --> 16:43.280
I mean, if I go this time,

159
16:43.280 --> 16:46.880
I have to oversee the hotel construction, which probably takes...

160
16:46.880 --> 16:50.040
like seven to eight years.

161
16:50.040 --> 16:53.640
That's a no.

162
16:53.640 --> 16:57.080
I'd rather be here.

163
16:57.080 --> 17:00.080
Working here means I get to stay with our son too.

164
17:10.520 --> 17:17.000
But Chian, you've always supported me,

165
17:17.000 --> 17:20.760
almost all my life.

166
17:20.760 --> 17:25.040
Let me support you for once.

167
17:25.040 --> 17:28.040
Go follow your dream.

168
17:28.040 --> 17:32.800
I can stay with our boy.

169
17:32.800 --> 17:35.360
And during school breaks,

170
17:35.360 --> 17:42.280
we can always fly over to see you.

171
17:55.480 --> 18:01.240
So this means we have to part again?

172
18:42.400 --> 18:46.160
Gelz.

173
18:49.360 --> 18:52.920
Yo!

174
19:01.400 --> 19:04.400
I'll be up here, so down you go.

175
19:20.560 --> 19:22.680
About your dad moving to the States...

176
19:22.680 --> 19:24.920
If you need any help, just let me know.

177
19:24.920 --> 19:26.800
Yeah.

178
19:26.800 --> 19:28.520
Same goes for you.

179
19:28.520 --> 19:34.400
If there's anything you need help with, you can tell me too.

180
19:34.400 --> 19:39.680
I really wanted your dads to get back together, you know.

181
19:39.680 --> 19:43.800
That day...

182
19:43.800 --> 19:46.800
I'm sorry I didn't finish the story.

183
19:47.880 --> 19:50.960
I just didn't want you to get hurt.

184
19:50.960 --> 19:53.960
I'm really sorry.

185
20:04.640 --> 20:06.680
Right.

186
20:06.680 --> 20:08.240
Then finish the story.

187
20:08.240 --> 20:11.320
Tell me how your dads and mine made up in the end.

188
20:11.320 --> 20:14.320
Call it your redemption.

189
20:15.520 --> 20:18.520
Yeah, deal.

190
20:37.480 --> 20:40.480
Though once I finish telling it...

191
20:40.480 --> 20:43.480
will you be my boyfriend?

192
21:14.600 --> 21:18.280
Fine, I'll just tell it.

193
21:29.200 --> 21:32.880
I'd like it made into a flower bouquet, please.

194
21:32.880 --> 21:36.280
Is this for the Fou4Mod fan meeting?

195
21:36.280 --> 21:43.280
Yes, it is.

196
21:43.280 --> 21:46.760
You can make it a really big one.

197
21:46.760 --> 21:50.000
Look, I recognize you from X.

198
21:50.000 --> 21:52.640
I don't support harassing the artist.

199
21:52.640 --> 21:56.440
Please take your business to another shop.

200
21:56.440 --> 21:59.480
Calm down, I'm not actually going to the event myself.

201
21:59.480 --> 22:02.640
I'm just having it delivered to him, asking a friend to bring it.

202
22:02.640 --> 22:05.400
I'm not doing it. Please go find another shop.

203
22:31.880 --> 22:33.640
I've got Fou4Mod giveaways to hand out!

204
22:33.640 --> 22:34.800
Anyone interested?

205
22:34.800 --> 22:39.920
Tons of them, starting right from his very first event.

206
22:39.920 --> 22:41.960
Here you go. Hey, please keep rooting for our boy.

207
22:41.960 --> 22:43.560
Don't disappear, okay? Keep supporting him.

208
22:43.560 --> 22:45.080
May our fandom grow huge.

209
22:45.080 --> 22:47.200
All right, thank you so much.

210
22:47.200 --> 22:49.760
Anyone who hasn't gotten one can still come grab some.

211
22:57.720 --> 23:00.320
Where are you? A certain celebrity wants to see you.

212
23:00.320 --> 23:01.840
Meet me in front of the staff room, okay?

213
23:11.400 --> 23:12.920
Is something up?

214
23:12.920 --> 23:15.920
Nothing, I just wanted to see you.

215
23:19.240 --> 23:21.680
Here.

216
23:29.480 --> 23:31.880
Is this for me?

217
23:37.920 --> 23:40.920
Come find me after the show's over, okay? Let's take some photos.

218
23:48.920 --> 23:51.600
Sure.

219
23:53.800 --> 23:56.760
Hey, I made tons of giveaways myself, you know.

220
23:56.760 --> 23:58.240
Got everything right here,

221
23:58.240 --> 24:01.240
hair clips, stickers, all of it.

222
24:05.120 --> 24:08.120
Wanna take some? You could wear them during the show.

223
24:14.040 --> 24:16.480
Just give them to me after the event.

224
24:16.480 --> 24:19.480
I'll keep them for you.

225
24:24.200 --> 24:27.200
And didn't you make any giveaways for Bua?

226
24:30.880 --> 24:33.440
No.

227
24:33.440 --> 24:36.440
Better stick to solo stan, I'm not really feeling the ex-boyfriend dynamic.

228
24:49.240 --> 24:52.240
Baa.

229
24:53.680 --> 24:56.680
There's something I need to tell you.

230
24:57.560 --> 25:00.560
What is it?

231
25:01.880 --> 25:04.880
That whole ship thing with Bua...

232
25:06.000 --> 25:09.000
Sure, it started with him,

233
25:10.880 --> 25:13.880
but he didn't do it because he wanted clout.

234
25:19.720 --> 25:22.720
And he didn't even do it to help me out.

235
25:26.480 --> 25:29.480
He did it because of you.

236
25:35.400 --> 25:38.400
Bua!

237
25:38.640 --> 25:39.960
I love you so damn much, you know that?

238
25:39.960 --> 25:42.960
Where did I fall short taking care of you?

239
30:02.480 --> 30:06.040
Where are you going? Your mom went back to Khon Kaen already...

240
30:17.320 --> 30:18.880
15 comments

241
30:18.880 --> 30:20.320
My brain is rotting...

242
30:20.320 --> 30:22.000
Auntie here is kicking her feet!

243
30:22.000 --> 30:23.360
I'm not gonna lie, the chemistry is there!

244
30:23.360 --> 30:26.360
Don't mess with my feelings!

245
30:34.440 --> 30:37.440
Bua: Hey...

246
30:43.840 --> 30:46.840
Fou4Mod: Yeah?

247
30:46.840 --> 30:48.840
I don't know how to do this.

248
30:48.840 --> 30:51.840
Just fan service, normal stuff.

249
30:56.480 --> 31:00.800
Alright, I'll just follow along.

250
31:08.280 --> 31:10.720
I hid all the clips and photos of Baa on my socials,

251
31:10.720 --> 31:13.720
ready to post our ship photos now.

252
31:14.920 --> 31:17.920
Then you go leave a comment, anything will do.

253
31:20.280 --> 31:23.280
What about Baa?

254
31:38.640 --> 31:40.240
I want him to see

255
31:40.240 --> 31:43.240
that your very first fan meet sold out.

256
31:46.240 --> 31:49.240
His whole happiness is stanning you.

257
31:52.080 --> 31:55.080
Are you okay?

258
32:04.000 --> 32:11.880
Honestly, he even told me not to tell you,

259
32:12.840 --> 32:17.640
because he knew that if you found out, you'd never let him do it, right?

260
32:25.840 --> 32:27.960
Well, good thing I've got a big mouth.

261
32:27.960 --> 32:30.960
Already blabbed...

262
32:36.840 --> 32:41.800
So you...

263
32:42.080 --> 32:44.240
go easy on him, okay?

264
32:52.600 --> 32:53.840
Alright, man.

265
32:55.400 --> 32:56.720
Go get your makeup done.

266
32:56.720 --> 32:57.760
Alright.

267
33:01.360 --> 33:02.400
Bye.

268
33:02.400 --> 33:03.600
See ya.

269
33:03.600 --> 33:04.840
Don't forget to scream for me.

270
33:05.160 --> 33:07.600
I'll scream right away.

271
33:07.600 --> 33:08.480
Make sure I can hear you.

272
33:08.480 --> 33:10.320
Fou4Mod!

273
34:16.880 --> 34:18.880
Come on, P Four, Bua!

274
34:18.880 --> 34:19.360
Yes.

275
34:19.360 --> 34:21.080
One real-time story, let's go!

276
34:21.080 --> 34:22.400
Give me some spice, don't keep it bland.

277
34:22.639 --> 34:24.840
Slay it today, alright?

278
34:24.840 --> 34:26.080
Got it.

279
34:26.280 --> 34:27.440
Be good today.

280
34:28.000 --> 34:28.960
Right, so how should we do the story?

281
34:28.960 --> 34:29.440
Show some love today.

282
34:29.440 --> 34:30.000
How should we film it?

283
34:30.000 --> 34:32.719
First off, sit down for me right here.

284
34:32.719 --> 34:33.480
Keep it real-time.

285
34:33.480 --> 34:34.480
P Four.

286
34:34.480 --> 34:34.880
Yeah?

287
34:34.880 --> 34:35.760
Stop eating.

288
34:35.760 --> 34:36.320
Okay.

289
34:36.320 --> 34:38.360
Give me one take, then you can go back to eating.

290
34:38.360 --> 34:38.920
Sure thing, Mee.

291
34:38.920 --> 34:41.000
Come on, sweetie, stand up.

292
34:41.000 --> 34:42.600
Be sweet today, no being stubborn.

293
34:42.600 --> 34:43.040
Got it, got it.

294
34:43.040 --> 34:44.000
No bickering!

295
34:44.000 --> 34:44.719
Alright, so in love, so in love...

296
34:44.719 --> 34:47.719
Loving each other, totally loving each other.

297
34:58.720 --> 35:02.400
We're just framing the shot.

298
35:02.400 --> 35:03.840
Are you sulking or what?

299
35:03.840 --> 35:06.840
I'm not sulking. Why would I?

300
35:09.280 --> 35:12.280
You look upset, though.

301
35:14.360 --> 35:17.360
Want some?

302
35:22.400 --> 35:25.400
Here.

303
35:30.640 --> 35:33.560
It's too spicy. Now I get why you're grumpy.

304
35:33.560 --> 35:36.560
Let's boost the cute vibes instead.

305
35:38.680 --> 35:41.680
Thank you.

306
35:50.200 --> 35:53.200
Hurry up, I know you like it.

307
35:55.480 --> 35:58.480
Here comes the train...

308
36:14.920 --> 36:17.440
Can they get any closer?

309
36:17.440 --> 36:20.440
Yeah, just like that...

310
36:30.280 --> 36:31.400
Okay.

311
36:31.400 --> 36:34.400
Are they dry yet? Blow on them.

312
36:52.600 --> 36:53.920
Alright, that's about it!

313
36:53.920 --> 36:56.400
Cut!

314
36:56.400 --> 36:58.920
Auntie's shipping heart is exploding!

315
