410
48:14.480 --> 48:16.680
This is me giving you kisses.

411
48:16.680 --> 48:23.000
Muah. Muah. Muah. Muah. Muah.

412
48:33.840 --> 48:38.080
Nothing matters more to me than you.

413
48:45.040 --> 48:48.040
Loving you is the easiest thing in the world for me.

414
48:49.920 --> 48:52.920
I don't have to try at all, you know that?

415
48:55.960 --> 48:58.960
Please take me back.

416
49:00.080 --> 49:01.960
Ever since we broke up, I haven't been able to sleep.

417
49:09.960 --> 49:12.960
I really need you in my life.

418
49:17.640 --> 49:19.480
When I broke up with you that day...

419
49:19.480 --> 49:21.600
I take it back, I unsend it.

420
49:21.600 --> 49:23.440
Cancel, undo, erase it all completely.

421
49:23.440 --> 49:26.440
Just wipe it right out of your head, okay?

422
49:34.200 --> 49:37.200
I'm so sorry.

423
50:11.160 --> 50:13.280
Are you okay?

424
50:13.280 --> 50:16.280
Feeling better?

425
50:20.520 --> 50:23.520
Much better.

426
50:26.240 --> 50:28.960
Bua, get ready for the stage, please.

427
50:28.960 --> 50:30.440
I'm about to pee my pants.

428
50:30.440 --> 50:32.200
It's fine, it's fine.

429
50:32.200 --> 50:33.320
I can't do this.

430
50:33.320 --> 50:35.480
Wait, wait, here's the plan.

431
50:35.480 --> 50:38.480
If you get nervous, just look my way.

432
50:38.480 --> 50:42.240
I'll scream so loud you'll definitely hear me.

433
50:42.240 --> 50:44.480
But you bought nosebleed tickets, I won't hear a thing.

434
50:47.200 --> 50:50.200
Bua, this isn't just the voice of a fan.

435
50:50.200 --> 50:53.200
This is the voice of your boyfriend.

436
50:53.200 --> 50:56.400
Trust me, believe in me, okay?

437
50:56.400 --> 50:59.200
I can do this for you, alright?

438
51:04.760 --> 51:09.480
Give me a hug, come on. You got this.

439
51:09.480 --> 51:14.880
If you get stressed or worried, just look right at me, okay?

440
52:14.600 --> 52:17.600
Bua Waterlily!

441
52:25.880 --> 52:34.160
Bua Waterlily!

442
52:50.040 --> 52:51.800
Go, go, Bua!

443
52:51.800 --> 52:54.800
Bua, Bua, go, go!

444
54:19.280 --> 54:22.280
Thank you so much for being my guest today.

445
54:27.040 --> 54:28.720
And thank you so, so much for...

446
54:28.720 --> 54:34.240
becoming such a wonderful part of my life.

447
54:36.280 --> 54:40.760
Not just wonderful parts, you got a sharp mouth too.

448
54:40.760 --> 54:43.760
Even during the thank-you speech, seriously?

449
54:45.880 --> 54:49.840
I just hope that...

450
54:50.040 --> 54:56.080
we'll stay by each other's side like this. Consider it understood.

451
54:56.080 --> 54:59.080
Thank you, P Four.

452
55:20.640 --> 55:28.760
I just want to say...

453
55:37.200 --> 55:42.280
to make it to where we are today,

454
55:46.720 --> 55:49.720
we've been through so much together, haven't we?

455
55:59.560 --> 56:02.560
It feels like no time has passed,

456
56:06.440 --> 56:10.280
yet so much damn shit has happened.

457
56:10.280 --> 56:14.400
I’d be so happy...

458
56:14.400 --> 56:18.560
if I got to see you as everyone's P Four...

459
56:18.560 --> 56:26.320
Baby Four,

460
56:26.320 --> 56:29.560
and Little Four

461
56:31.240 --> 56:34.240
to everyone, like this forever.

462
56:39.120 --> 56:42.120
I'm so proud of you.

463
56:56.320 --> 57:03.960
What? Am I making you emotional?

464
57:03.960 --> 57:06.960
P Fou4Mod.

465
57:46.320 --> 57:47.800
Thank you. Bye-bye.

466
57:47.800 --> 57:49.240
Get home safely.

467
57:49.240 --> 57:52.240
Bye-bye, mommy.

468
58:00.280 --> 58:02.640
I planned on screaming loud enough to drown you out,

469
58:02.640 --> 58:05.400
