470
58:06.120 --> 58:09.120
I'm so freakin' proud of myself for making your dream come true.

471
58:09.600 --> 58:11.240
Thank you so much.

472
58:11.240 --> 58:14.240
Now I can retire from being a stan with zero regrets.

473
58:14.600 --> 58:17.600
Thanks.

474
58:18.080 --> 58:21.080
You did great.

475
58:37.680 --> 58:40.240
Hi.

476
58:46.320 --> 58:49.320
I probably won't get to see P Four for a long time,

477
58:55.560 --> 59:01.080
so I bought ten hi-touch benefits right here.

478
59:39.280 --> 59:42.080
Nine more to go, I'll be back.

479
01:00:29.320 --> 01:00:32.320
Fou4Mod, are you alright?

480
01:00:32.320 --> 01:00:35.320
Fou4Mod, are you alright?

481
01:01:58.080 --> 01:01:58.400
Son.

482
01:02:02.440 --> 01:02:07.280
Son, pack up all those Daddy Fou4Mod giveaways

483
01:02:07.280 --> 01:02:09.480
