484
01:02:09.480 --> 01:02:12.480
I'm taking them with me, gonna stick 'em on the fridge over there.

485
01:02:12.840 --> 01:02:15.720
Got it.

486
01:02:15.720 --> 01:02:18.720
Here you go.

487
01:03:03.320 --> 01:03:06.320
As long as I have this, I'm good.

488
01:03:07.240 --> 01:03:10.240
"Miss you, you've got this today!"

489
01:03:12.320 --> 01:03:15.320
Well, I'm definitely not good.

490
01:03:57.160 --> 01:04:00.160
What's the show tomorrow? Give me a spoiler.

491
01:04:14.480 --> 01:04:18.640
I wrote this song based on the story of my dads' love,

492
01:04:18.640 --> 01:04:20.920
and I want to sing it for my two dads,

493
01:04:20.920 --> 01:04:26.080
Gen Z gel-nail boys who love each other so much.

494
01:04:28.200 --> 01:04:35.360
I also want to sing this for anyone looking to make their boyfriend their bias.

495
01:05:24.160 --> 01:05:30.280
Hello, everyone. I have a confession to make.

496
01:05:30.280 --> 01:05:33.720
The person everyone assumed was a sasaeng

497
01:05:33.720 --> 01:05:36.320
isn't a sasaeng at all.

498
01:05:36.320 --> 01:05:39.320
He's my boyfriend.

499
01:05:43.200 --> 01:05:46.080
The reason he claimed to be a sasaeng

500
01:05:46.080 --> 01:05:50.520
was simply to protect me,

501
01:05:50.520 --> 01:05:53.520
so that I could remain beloved by everyone just the same.

502
01:05:58.080 --> 01:06:01.080
And I chose to keep this a secret.

503
01:06:04.080 --> 01:06:11.200
It was my fault. I wasn't brave enough to own up to it

504
01:06:11.200 --> 01:06:14.720
and tell you all the truth.

505
01:06:14.720 --> 01:06:18.400
But today, I've learned that

506
01:06:18.400 --> 01:06:24.720
the person whose hand I want to hold the most

507
01:06:24.720 --> 01:06:27.720
through every moment of my life,

508
01:06:30.360 --> 01:06:33.360
it shouldn't only be when no one is watching,

509
01:06:34.600 --> 01:06:37.600
but especially during the moments I'm happiest.

510
01:06:54.960 --> 01:07:00.400
Normally, I never post photos of my boyfriend

511
01:07:00.400 --> 01:07:04.400
because I'm very possessive.

512
01:07:04.400 --> 01:07:10.520
But today, I want all of you to know him.

513
01:07:10.520 --> 01:07:13.520
I want him to be surrounded by love,

514
01:07:17.600 --> 01:07:20.600
just as much as I love him.

515
01:07:32.280 --> 01:07:35.280
And I truly apologize to everyone from the bottom of my heart

516
01:07:36.080 --> 01:07:38.760
for letting you down.

517
01:07:40.800 --> 01:07:42.040
I'm still the same Fou4Mod,

518
01:07:42.640 --> 01:07:45.360
the one who wants to keep bringing joy to all of you.

519
01:07:45.360 --> 01:07:46.600
Thank you.

520
01:08:51.200 --> 01:08:51.880
So disappointed.

521
01:08:51.880 --> 01:08:52.560
I'm done.

522
01:08:52.560 --> 01:08:53.160
I'm heartbroken. Let me cry and reset tonight, then I'll be back.

523
01:08:53.160 --> 01:08:54.000
I'm hurt.

524
01:08:54.000 --> 01:08:54.720
I'm sorry I ever trusted you, P Four.

525
01:08:54.720 --> 01:08:55.279
Why did you have to lie to us?

526
01:08:55.279 --> 01:08:56.000
I love you, P Four, but this is too much to take.

527
01:08:56.000 --> 01:08:56.760
Not gonna lie, this hurts. But once I process it, I'll be back.

528
01:08:57.000 --> 01:08:58.240
Unfollowing now.

529
01:09:25.000 --> 01:09:27.399
Thank you for telling us the whole truth.

530
01:09:27.399 --> 01:09:28.840
It shows that you really care about

531
01:09:28.840 --> 01:09:31.200
and value SUGAR's feelings.

532
01:09:31.200 --> 01:09:34.200
This SUGAR will always love and support you, P Four.

533
01:10:04.000 --> 01:10:04.920
How did it go?

534
01:10:04.920 --> 01:10:06.120
Have you seen it, Chian?

535
01:10:06.120 --> 01:10:08.400
I have.

536
01:10:13.600 --> 01:10:15.280
I'm so glad.

537
01:10:15.280 --> 01:10:17.040
You're amazing.

538
01:10:32.160 --> 01:10:33.480
You're doing great!

539
01:10:35.960 --> 01:10:38.280
Hey, stake your claim a little.

540
01:10:38.280 --> 01:10:39.640
What? Are you a celebrity?

541
01:10:39.640 --> 01:10:40.800
