542
01:10:40.800 --> 01:10:43.960
I'm your boyfriend now, aren't I?

543
01:10:43.960 --> 01:10:45.320
I'm a celebrity's boyfriend.

544
01:10:46.480 --> 01:10:49.480
Let's see it then.

545
01:11:24.160 --> 01:11:27.000
Gelz, look at the camera.

546
01:11:27.000 --> 01:11:30.000
Gelz, you look so handsome.

547
01:11:42.560 --> 01:11:44.680
Sign this for me, will you?

548
01:11:44.680 --> 01:11:47.680
Me?

549
01:11:47.680 --> 01:11:50.680
Well, who else would it be?

550
01:11:52.000 --> 01:11:55.000
Open it.

551
01:12:37.720 --> 01:12:41.160
When did you even take this?

552
01:12:41.160 --> 01:12:43.680
When do you ever see me not taking it?

553
01:12:43.680 --> 01:12:45.880
Snap, flash!

554
01:12:45.880 --> 01:12:48.800
Slay, bang, raise that camera...

555
01:12:48.800 --> 01:12:51.800
I'm literally your CCTV.

556
01:12:55.160 --> 01:12:57.040
Look,

557
01:12:57.040 --> 01:12:59.320
I'll just confess.

558
01:12:59.320 --> 01:13:02.320
The truth is, I never stanned anyone that hard.

559
01:13:03.720 --> 01:13:06.720
I only stanned because of you.

560
01:13:12.480 --> 01:13:15.480
Because I'm your stan.

561
01:13:17.960 --> 01:13:20.600
You stan me?

562
01:13:20.600 --> 01:13:22.120
For real?

563
01:13:24.480 --> 01:13:29.840
Listen, I think I fell for you precisely because you're a stan.

564
01:13:34.760 --> 01:13:36.080
Look at those eyes.

565
01:13:36.080 --> 01:13:37.200
Whenever you stan someone...

566
01:13:37.200 --> 01:13:38.360
it's like...

567
01:13:38.360 --> 01:13:39.880
so playful...

568
01:13:39.880 --> 01:13:42.120
like a tiny little puppy.

569
01:13:42.120 --> 01:13:45.720
It's adorable.

570
01:13:45.720 --> 01:13:48.720
It's exceeding the cuteness quota again, right?

571
01:13:57.280 --> 01:14:01.240
But now that you're done stanning, I just feel like

572
01:14:01.240 --> 01:14:07.000
this book has fully served its purpose.

573
01:14:07.000 --> 01:14:10.000
So I want you

574
01:14:14.960 --> 01:14:17.960
