575
01:14:18.480 --> 01:14:21.480
Of course.

576
01:14:26.080 --> 01:14:29.080
Hello, what is your name?

577
01:14:32.000 --> 01:14:35.000
It's Buaban.

578
01:14:38.440 --> 01:14:41.440
All set, Buaban!

579
01:14:43.880 --> 01:14:49.640
Congrats, you chose the right person. By: Tiny little puppy.

580
01:15:01.480 --> 01:15:04.480
Hey, this reminds me of when we used to stan people together.

581
01:15:44.600 --> 01:15:46.160
Gelz...

582
01:15:46.160 --> 01:15:48.320
Daddy Bua said his heart was racing.

583
01:15:48.320 --> 01:15:50.960
