584
01:15:50.960 --> 01:15:53.960
Hey, Babe, I'm so happy for you.

585
01:15:54.480 --> 01:15:55.520
Gelz...

586
01:15:55.520 --> 01:15:57.680
I have something to tell you.

587
01:15:57.680 --> 01:16:00.680
