588
01:16:04.920 --> 01:16:07.920
Where are we going?

589
01:16:46.320 --> 01:16:49.320
Babe...

590
01:16:53.120 --> 01:16:54.600
Can we forget about that promise...

591
01:16:54.600 --> 01:16:57.600
