592
01:16:59.600 --> 01:17:02.120
I'm scared of my nails falling off...

593
01:17:13.520 --> 01:17:16.520
The thing is...

594
01:17:18.120 --> 01:17:21.120
I'm going to the States with my daddies.

595
01:17:22.680 --> 01:17:25.680
I don't want them to be apart anymore.

596
01:17:52.000 --> 01:17:55.000
I think you're making the right choice.

597
01:17:59.800 --> 01:18:02.800
Thank you.

598
01:18:15.440 --> 01:18:18.440
It's okay, I understand.

599
01:19:01.640 --> 01:19:04.040
C'mon, let's take some photos.

600
01:19:04.040 --> 01:19:05.880
Let's show off the nails too.

601
01:19:05.880 --> 01:19:08.880
One, two, three.

602
01:19:09.440 --> 01:19:10.680
One more...

603
01:19:10.680 --> 01:19:13.680
One, two, three.

604
01:19:17.440 --> 01:19:20.440
Stick your tongues out too.

605
01:19:28.120 --> 01:19:31.120
Gelboys!

606
01:19:35.640 --> 01:19:38.640
